  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed dormer and canopy, by reason of their siting, scale, and design, would represent an overly dominant and incongruous form of development that would erode the original appearance of the host property. The scheme would cause less than substantial harm to the CA70 Sheen Lane Mortlake Conservation Area of which it forms part, and there are considered to be no public benefits to outweigh this harm. As such, the proposal would be contrary to the NPPF, and the London Borough of Richmond upon Thames Local Plan (2025), in particular policies 28 & 29, the House Extensions and External Alterations SPD as supported by the CA 70 Sheen Lane Mortlake Conservation Area Statement."
